      "label": "Initial state ranges"
    }
  ],
  "functional_requirements": [
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-008-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Each request departs from the original lift, creates actual results in cell 3, cell 4, and then returns and descends to the original lift."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-009-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Cancellation requests retrieve each access part and return it to the original lift."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-010-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The lift preparation and entry into an empty cell for the next request may overlap with the subsequent cell work of the previous request."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-012-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Connect the validity of reference generation and registered values and exclude outdated captures of other requests."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-018-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "A new sequence number is required to execute a new connection."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-021-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Registration captures the passage of a new position for the request ID and stops at the value +250 mm."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-022-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The reference axis is set while the working axis is stopped, and the actual target is converted to match the reference."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-024-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Then, all axes are returned to the disclosed initial connection posture and withdrawn."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-014-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Use the actual connection X disclosed by D input, lift connection height, and cell connection posture."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-025-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "After the corresponding request jig returns to the original lift section and stops at the initial height, it responds with the ID and status (completion 1, cancellation retrieval 2)."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-032-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Check both the request ID and capture_epoch=epoch, capture the new pass at the current reference, and use it."
    },
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-motion-contract-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Before crossing the registration mark, set the capture selection to the ID of the jig currently in that cell. A new crossing records that ID and the current reference epoch; a retained response from another request or epoch is not valid completion evidence."
    }
  ],
  "safety_constraints": [
    {
      "id": "MOT-H14-033-1",
      "kind": "text",
